# CircuitVerse Studio

### Design. Simulate. Explore.

CircuitVerse Studio is an interactive engineering education platform designed to help students explore electronics, digital circuits and simulations.

## Live Website

https://saanyuvarma-sys.github.io/CircuitVerse-Studio/

## Laboratories

1. Electronics Lab
2. Aerospace Lab
3. Simulation Lab

## Features

- Interactive circuit design
- Component placement and wiring
- Digital circuit simulation
- Project saving and exporting
- Educational simulation tools

## Technology

HTML, CSS and JavaScript.

